{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018gHWpLV5V1dhDbVYeixBLm","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Malcolm McLean containerization quote shipping container standardization attributed source\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Malcolm Purcell McLean: Father of Container Shipping | Ship4wd\",\"url\":\"https://ship4wd.com/logistics-shipping/malcolm-purcell-mclean\"},{\"title\":\"#61 Malcom McLean The Box How the Shipping Container Made the World Smaller and the World Economy Bigger\",\"url\":\"https://www.deciphr.ai/podcast/61-malcom-mclean-the-box-how-the-shipping-container-made-the-world-smaller-and-the-world-economy-bigger\"},{\"title\":\"Heroes of Progress, Pt. 17: Malcom McLean - Human Progress\",\"url\":\"https://humanprogress.org/heroes-of-progress-pt-17-malcom-mclean/\"},{\"title\":\"Malcolm McLean: The Unsung Capitalist Hero Who Changed the World One Container at a Time | Mises Institute\",\"url\":\"https://mises.org/mises-wire/malcolm-mclean-unsung-capitalist-hero-who-changed-world-one-container-time\"},{\"title\":\"Malcolm McLean: The Visionary Who Revolutionized Global Trade with Shipping Containers - CBM Calculator - Blog\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbmcalculator.com/blog/malcolm-mclean-the-visionary-who-revolutionized-global-trade-with-shipping-containers/\"},{\"title\":\"The birth of the shipping container | Eveon Containers\",\"url\":\"https://www.eveoncontainers.com/en-US/news/market-insights/the-birth-of-the-sea-container\"},{\"title\":\"FreightWaves Classics/Pioneers: Malcom McLean changed the freight world with intermodal containers – Naegeli Transportation, Inc.\",\"url\":\"https://heavyhaultexas.com/freightwaves-classics-pioneers-malcom-mclean-changed-the-freight-world-with-intermodal-containers/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Malcolm McLean and containerization:\n\n## Key Information:\n\nMcLean's concept of \"containerization\" involved using standardized, removable containers that could be conveniently transferred between trucks, trains, and ships. By standardizing container sizes (20ft and 40ft), McLean enabled seamless transfers between ships, trucks, and trains—intermodal transport was born.\n\n## Attribution and Standardization:\n\nMcLean released the patent for his container to the International Organization for Standardization, royalty-free. Tantlinger managed to convince McLean to make the patented design available to the International Organization for Standardization at no cost, thus bringing about major growth in the industry.\n\n## Notable Quote:\n\nThe search results include this attributed quote reflecting the maritime industry's resistance: \"For men who had prospered in this environment, an artificial environment, Malcolm McLean's wholly unromantic interest in moving freight in boxes had little appeal.\"\n\nThe search results provide extensive information about McLean's contributions to containerization and standardization, though they don't contain a single famous direct quote from McLean himself specifically about containerization or standardization. The sources do emphasize his focus on efficiency and standardization throughout his work.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89558532-ef37-43d4-ab5c-e8bf2bfb520f","uuid":"1b42369b-0291-4905-bd19-e9df368333a0","timestamp":"2026-08-24T05:01:37.325Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Malcolm McLean containerization quote shipping container standardization attributed source","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01B3hoKxHo3HvCDoEfJXL7kZ","content":[{"title":"Malcolm Purcell McLean: Father of Container Shipping | Ship4wd","url":"https://ship4wd.com/logistics-shipping/malcolm-purcell-mclean"},{"title":"#61 Malcom McLean The Box How the Shipping Container Made the World Smaller and the World Economy Bigger","url":"https://www.deciphr.ai/podcast/61-malcom-mclean-the-b